@startuml railway_simple
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam linetype ortho

actor "Pengguna" as Users
cloud "Internet" as Internet
cloud "Platform Railway" as Railway {
    rectangle "Website MIW\nAplikasi PHP" as App
    database "Database\nMySQL" as DB
}

Users --> Internet : Mengakses miw.co.id
Internet --> App : HTTPS
App --> DB : Simpan/Ambil Data

note top of Railway
Railway secara otomatis mengelola:
• Web hosting
• Manajemen database
• Sertifikat SSL
• Penyimpanan file
end note

@enduml
